[00:20.22]1. Beauty fills the earth,
[00:24.00]wonder fills our mind—
[00:26.84]The work of your hands
[00:30.24]so patiently designed.
[00:34.80]Though the world may change,
[00:38.02]you remain the same.
[00:41.38]You patiently wait
[00:45.02]to make it new again.
[00:50.88](Chorus)
[00:50.88]Father, we long to see
[00:54.00]Paradise come to be.
[00:59.52]Give us the patience to wait.
[01:05.18]We know your day will come,
[01:09.20]sure as the rising sun.
[01:13.76]No matter how long it takes,
[01:20.30]“It will not be late!”
[01:31.29]2. Faithfully we wait
[01:35.05]for the dead to rise.
[01:37.55]Jehovah, you yearn
[01:41.40]to bring them back to life.
[01:46.25]Father, we well know
[01:49.23]how you loved them so.
[01:52.97]Instill in our hearts
[01:56.37]the patience you have shown.
[02:00.91](Chorus)
[02:02.09]Father, we long to see
[02:05.25]Paradise come to be.
[02:10.79]Give us the patience to wait.
[02:16.53]We know your day will come,
[02:20.15]sure as the rising sun.
[02:24.95]No matter how long it takes,
[02:30.93]“It will not be late!”
[02:42.69]3. Patiently you search;
[02:46.51]honest hearts you find.
[02:49.05]You heal them with hope
[02:52.59]and long to give them life.
[02:57.35]Working by your side,
[03:00.73]sharing what is true,
[03:03.89]We use our time well.
[03:07.67]It draws us close to you.
[03:13.43](Chorus)
[03:13.43]Father, we long to see
[03:16.67]Paradise come to be.
[03:22.21]Give us the patience to wait.
[03:28.31]We know your day will come,
[03:32.23]sure as the rising sun.
[03:36.49]No matter how long it takes,
[03:43.05]“It will not be late!”
[03:54.27]Father, please help us to wait!
